 {:db/id "q-164400" :question/id #uuid "7c06a8e8-6e3d-50f3-ae2e-200f38471a76" :question/math-academy-id "q-164400" :question/problem "What is the trace in the $yz$-plane of the parabolic cylinder $(x+3)^{2}=6y?$" :question/worked-solution "To find the trace in the $yz$-plane, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the cylinder, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(0+3)^{2} & =6y \\\\ 9 & =6y \\\\ y & =\\frac{9}{6} \\\\ y & =\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of a line in the $yz$-plane." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-164400/ma-source-field/55397008b90858ad230e2c1656f94d24b8c0296ededd8968e4f802bb3975ff91"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
